    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511020/extras/bb65d7cdf63059db6f54ff48299f72b7.avif?t=1750755674\" width=594 height=234 /></span><i>.</i><br><i>You find yourself in a strange cafe where everyone insists you try a cup of sorrel coffee. But be careful: each sip reboot reality and puts you in a new world filled with mysteries and dangers. Who are you? Why can\u2019t you remember anything? And why are you being hunted my monster-girls and armed agents?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511020/extras/b82c41e99e41ae1a891f2524ba8824a3.avif?t=1750755674\" width=594 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the game, you\u2019ll:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Talk with three mysterious girls, each with their own secrets;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Uncover the truth behind this strange world where nothing is as it seems;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Make choices that will lead you to one of six unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 A short but intense story with unexpected twists;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 A unique visual style: characters, scenes and backgrounds were all drawn by hand;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 An original soundtrack that adds a feeling of intensity and mystery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511020/extras/bb65d7cdf63059db6f54ff48299f72b7.avif?t=1750755674\" width=594 height=234 /></span><i>.</i><br><i>You find yourself in a strange cafe where everyone insists you try a cup of sorrel coffee. But be careful: each sip reboot reality and puts you in a new world filled with mysteries and dangers. Who are you? Why can\u2019t you remember anything? And why are you being hunted my monster-girls and armed agents?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511020/extras/b82c41e99e41ae1a891f2524ba8824a3.avif?t=1750755674\" width=594 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the game, you\u2019ll:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Talk with three mysterious girls, each with their own secrets;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Uncover the truth behind this strange world where nothing is as it seems;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd6c Make choices that will lead you to one of six unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 A short but intense story with unexpected twists;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 A unique visual style: characters, scenes and backgrounds were all drawn by hand;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf75 An original soundtrack that adds a feeling of intensity and mystery.</p>",
